ublicans and  we have realized that in the last 30  years the political the democratic party  has been playing political football with  us why do i say that because in 2008  president obama promised my community  and immigration reform law within the  first 100 days of his presidency nothing  he invested his political capital in  obamacare number two president biden  said it at the beginning of this year  within the first 100 days of my  presidency i'm going to do an  immigration reform law and what happened  once again he ditched us so now it's  time for the gop to welcome my people  and we will do an immigration reform law  that i'm trying to present god  permitting next  year you know for for the eight years i  was there they would bring in the  so-called immigration experts um  all of whom looked a lot like me and  said you need to do the following things  or else you will never appeal to  hispanic voters and whether rightfully  or wrongfully the republican party  didn't do any of those things so  were the experts wrong or or  what explains this this evolution  within the hispanic community towards  the republican party  what i just said is that we have  realized after 30 years after ronald  reagan who was the last president who  gave this community  some type of legality we have realized  that for 30 years the democratic party  has been playing political football so  what i said to my community is that you  got to be with whomever serves  your values and whomever fixes your  problems we come here for two things we  come because we know this is the  promised land and we want to share those  fruits and we want to have a better  economy we want to be able to go from  rags to riches which is what this  american exceptionality promises i'm the  best example i am the cuban the daughter  of cuban refugees 60 years ago they came  when they were 25 years old to the  promised land because democratic  socialism had destroyed their cube of  their country and look at me i a